---
// Streaming 8 KB sliding buffer (Sum6Reader): handling split numbers across chunk boundaries in O(1) RAM.
const W = 900;
const H = 266;
---
<figure class="ge8c">
  <div class="ge8c-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="How Sum6Reader processes a 100M line file in constant 8 KB heap memory by parsing complete lines and copying any partial trailing digits back to index zero before the next Read.">
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="872" height="238" rx="10" class="ge8c-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="ge8c-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Streaming O(1) Heap Memory (8 KB buf) — How Sum6Reader stitches split numbers across Read() calls</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Xử lý Streaming chỉ tốn 8 KB RAM cố định — Cách Sum6Reader nối số bị cắt đôi giữa hai lần Read()</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Step 1: Read chunk 1 */}
      <text x="30" y="72" class="ge8c-b">1. r.Read(buf[0:]) fills chunk:</text>
      <rect x="274" y="54" width="446" height="28" rx="4" class="ge8c-bar" />
      <rect x="276" y="56" width="320" height="24" rx="3" class="ge8c-ok-fill" />
      <text x="288" y="72" class="ge8c-b-ok">1042\n9918\n7201\n (complete)</text>
      <rect x="600" y="56" width="118" height="24" rx="3" class="ge8c-warn-fill" />
      <text x="610" y="72" class="ge8c-b-red">458  (split!)</text>
      <text x="730" y="72" class="ge8c-m">last..n = tail</text>

      {/* Step 2: Shift partial bytes via copy */}
      <text x="30" y="120" class="ge8c-b">2. copy(buf, buf[last:n]):</text>
      <rect x="274" y="102" width="446" height="28" rx="4" class="ge8c-bar" />
      <rect x="276" y="104" width="118" height="24" rx="3" class="ge8c-warn-fill" />
      <text x="288" y="120" class="ge8c-b-red">458 (offset=3)</text>
      <text x="414" y="120" class="ge8c-m">[ ... 8,189 free bytes preserved cleanly ... ]</text>
      <text x="730" y="120" class="ge8c-m">0 extra allocs!</text>

      {/* Step 3: Next Read after offset */}
      <text x="30" y="168" class="ge8c-b">3. Next r.Read(buf[offset:]):</text>
      <rect x="274" y="150" width="446" height="28" rx="4" class="ge8c-bar" />
      <rect x="276" y="152" width="210" height="24" rx="3" class="ge8c-ok-fill" />
      <text x="288" y="168" class="ge8c-b-ok">458 + 902\n → parses 458902!</text>
      <rect x="490" y="152" width="228" height="24" rx="3" class="ge8c-idle" />
      <text x="504" y="168" class="ge8c-m">1130\n5519\n ... continues</text>

      {/* Bottom stats box */}
      <rect x="30" y="196" width="840" height="42" rx="6" class="ge8c-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="216" class="ge8c-b-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Result on 100M lines: 8.3 KB constant heap (even under runtime.MemProfileRate = 1) vs. 304 MB in Sum1</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Kết quả trên file 100 triệu dòng: luôn chỉ tốn ~8,3 KB Heap cố định (so với 304 MB ở bản Sum1) mà vẫn nhanh gấp 2x bufio.Scanner!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="232" class="ge8c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Two OS 4 KB pages in L1/L2 cache; avoids bufio.Scanner UTF-8/CR overhead while staying safe under io.EOF.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Kích thước 8 KB vừa khít 2 trang nhớ OS (4 KB) nên nằm gọn trong L1 cache; nhớ kiểm tra err != io.EOF trước khi thoát.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Moving from os.ReadFile (O(N) RAM) to Sum6Reader with a single reusable 8 KB buffer and tail-shifting cuts memory to O(1) while staying fast enough to match 6.9 ns/line.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Thay vì đọc hết file vào RAM bằng os.ReadFile, kỹ thuật đệm trượt 8 KB trong Sum6Reader giữ bộ nhớ ở mức O(1) dù file phình to tới 100 triệu dòng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge8c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge8c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge8c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge8c text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge8c-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge8c-bar { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge8c-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge8c-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8c-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8c-ok-fill { fill: rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.14); stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 1; }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8c-ok-fill { fill: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.14); stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8c-warn-fill { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1; }
  .ge8c-idle { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 3 3; stroke-width: 1; }
  .ge8c-h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge8c-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge8c-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .ge8c-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); font-size: 11.5px; }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8c-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8c-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge8c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
